## C3. Repeat the persona comparison: how far do the distributions move?

These bars show mean TV, not the percentage of comparisons that change. A mean TV of 30% means 30% of the probability mass would need to move on average. It does **not** mean that only 30% of texts were affected.
'''),code('''
